s\n\n### Two things I changed (Rust only, `c_src/` untouched)\n1. `Cargo.toml`: added `libloading` + `libc` dev-deps; `.cargo/config.toml` pins `RUST_TEST_THREADS=1` (fd 1 is process-global — parallel libtest progress text leaked into captures, which caused the initial 13 \"failures\") and `net.offline = true` (crates.io unreachable; both crates were in the local cache).\n2. `src/lib.rs`: added `#[allow(unused_assignments)]` + comment on `goodB2G`'s faithful dead store (`data = ' '` before `data = CHAR_MAX`) — cosmetic only.\n\nNotably the tricky C behavior the translation already got right: `printHexCharLine`'s signed-`char` → `int` promotion means `%02x` prints **eight** digits for negatives, so `bad()`'s `127*2` truncation emits `fffffffe`, not `fe`."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2312,"cache_read_input_tokens":73281,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2312,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1d4b1e0a-ff98-4894-94fb-41642b1143db","uuid":"2f35f199-c7f6-407c-9af0-3834cc9ab540","timestamp":"2026-09-05T03:56:20.161Z"}
